# Perception (`dondron_perception`)

## Topic contract (frozen at Line 1 gate)

| Topic | Type | Direction |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `/camera/image_raw` | `sensor_msgs/msg/Image` | subscribe |
| `/detections` | `vision_msgs/msg/Detection2DArray` | publish |

Camera-agnostic: swapping IMX219 for OAK-D / RealSense only changes the camera driver node.

## Monocular range (Phase 1)

```
range_m = (focal_length_px × real_target_width_m) / bbox_width_px
```

Target must be known physical size. Document focal length and target class in package README or params.

## Inference path

1. `cv_bridge` → OpenCV
2. RKNN on Orange Pi NPU (prod); stub or CPU/YOLO on dev/SIL
3. Publish `Detection2DArray` with bbox + class id + confidence

SIL without RKNN: stub publisher or Gazebo ground-truth bridge is acceptable for integration tests.

## Public boundary

Perception publishes `/detections` only. **No** setpoint or flight commands from this package.

